        "created_at": "2014-06-06T21:04:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I had a question about the Heroes and the Villains that are included in the Vengeance Mega Expansion. With the introduction of Vengeance, we have 4 new Villains (and alternate Baron Blade) as well as 5 new Heroes. Can any of these Villains and Heroes be played outside of the new gameplay setup that is introduced in Vengeance? Or are they \"barred\" to only playing within that format? And I guess my question would lead to changing out the Heroes from the base game and the Villains from the base game as well, how would that work?</p><p>My friends and I are new to the game, and I recently only picked up the Enhanced Edition, the Rook City and Infernal Relics Combo, as well as a few of the mini-expansion Heroes, Villains, and Environments. Hopefully looking to complete the set, but am just curious about these interactions. Thanks in advance for any input!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:41:33.480Z",
