        "raw": "<p>I had a question about the Heroes and the Villains that are included in the Vengeance Mega Expansion. With the introduction of Vengeance, we have 4 new Villains (and alternate Baron Blade) as well as 5 new Heroes. Can any of these Villains and Heroes be played outside of the new gameplay setup that is introduced in Vengeance? Or are they &quot;barred&quot; to only playing within that format? And I guess my question would lead to changing out the Heroes from the base game and the Villains from the base game as well, how would that work?</p><p>My friends and I are new to the game, and I recently only picked up the Enhanced Edition, the Rook City and Infernal Relics Combo, as well as a few of the mini-expansion Heroes, Villains, and Environments. Hopefully looking to complete the set, but am just curious about these interactions. Thanks in advance for any input!</p>",
