        "created_at": "2014-06-07T13:11:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've been curious, is it possible to play the heroes as villains and vice versa? Just switching the words \"villain targets\" for \"hero targets\"? I haven't gotten the chance to play Vengance yet, but is that theoretically possible?</p>",
