        "id": 105830,
        "name": "Medic-Tank",
        "username": "Medic-Tank",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/medic-tank/{size}/2107_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-09T14:27:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It's also possible to tweak in vengeance villains with classic villains in game of 4 or 5 heroes. Like say you find ambuscade boring and wont to spice things up a bit by giving him a partner that helps with his weakness: ongoing and equipment destruction. What I did in a 4 hero game was play Ambuscade as H=3 and add Ermine to the party. Environnment H is still 4 though. And Ermine would play between the 2nd and third hero to make it as even as possible.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>This is an unofficial use of vengeance and can make your game harder but when I tested it it works well especially against weak villains.</p>",
